    "text": "Missoula\nLords of Dirt Brings Flat Track Chaos to Missoula Fair\n11 hours ago\nYou don't visit the fair on Sunday every year without indulging in some fried food and grabbing your last ride bracelet, and of course catching the flat track bikes as they fly around the arena. It’s Lords of Dirt-return time again this year, and it’s still the loudest thing at the Western Montana Fair.",
